WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:09.000
The Eunuch has long attended Father. When this son wishes to fulfill his filial duties in the future, I must inevitably trouble the Eunuch's guidance.

00:12.880 --> 00:21.240
Before Your Highness arrived, officers from the Imperial City Guard rushed into the palace to seek an audience with His Majesty. As to what was discussed, this old servant could not say.

00:21.600 --> 00:28.000
Yet the moment they departed, His Majesty retired to the Imperial Elixir Chamber, saying he needed to quiet his mind... and wait for his son.

00:30.480 --> 00:32.000
My deepest thanks to Eunuch Wen for the warning.
